[00:00] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'If you\'re looking for a great vlogging camera that you can take anywhere, Insta360 offers two fantastic options with its latest releases: the Luna Ultra and the X6. From the outside, these cameras look completely different. One is a'

[00:12] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'stabilizer with a camera, and the other captures the whole world in 360 degrees, but both are great for creating beautiful vlogs, cinematic shots, and everyday moments. So in this video, I\'ll compare them across 15'

[00:25] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'different categories to help you figure out which one is best for your content. Let\'s start with the design of these two cameras. Of course, visually these are completely different cameras. The Luna Ultra is more like a standard'

[00:37] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'premium handheld gimbal. So if you\'ve used pocket-sized gimbals before, like the DJI Pocket series, it will feel very familiar. The way you hold this camera in your hand and shoot with it is'

[00:50] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'actually very similar to the process of taking a selfie on a smartphone. The X6, on the other hand, has a completely different design and feel. Honestly, I tried to remember what it reminded me of, and all that came to mind were those old'

[01:02] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Nokia phones my parents had when I was in fifth or sixth grade. It looks a bit like an old Nokia, but I don\'t hold it like a smartphone or a handheld gimbal. I usually shoot with it'

[01:16] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'using one of their invisible selfie sticks, which, thanks to a glue point between the two lenses, removes the stick itself from the frame. So, the selfie stick is almost invisible, allowing you'

[01:28] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'to hold the 360-degree camera in a more natural way. Therefore, in my opinion, the X6 needs accessories to properly hold and use it, especially for vlogging. Unlike it, Luna Ultra is quite comfortable even without additional devices'

[01:40] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: '. Now let\'s talk about image quality and the material that can be captured with these cameras. Honestly, I\'m very impressed with the image quality of both of these cameras. When you compare them side by side, both look great. By the way, these are the first'

